Package: mcp-server-cnb-cache
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends},
 python3-fastmcp (>= 4.1.4),
 python3-mcp,
 python3-httpx,
 python3-pydantic (>= 2),
Suggests: cnb-cache-mysql | cnb-cache-sqlite
Description: MCP server for Czech National Bank exchange rates
 Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that exposes CNB daily exchange rates,
 conversions and history, obtained from a cnb-cache instance over HTTP, as
 tools for AI agents such as Claude Desktop and Claude Code.

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-cnb-cache
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 mcprack (>= 1.6.0),
 mcp-server-cnb-cache (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Registers CNB Cache MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for mcp-server-cnb-cache. Installing it registers
 the mcp-server-cnb-cache binary as an available MCP server in the local
 mcprack instance; removing it unregisters it again.
